      "beat_id": "BDEFS",
      "act": "DEFINITIONS",
      "lane": "CARD",
      "narration_text": "Five words before we start. CLAUDE.md: constraints — what Claude may and may not do in this folder, read at the start of every session. DESIGN.md: every aesthetic decision, named — tone, type, colour, layout, and what silence means. PROJECT.md: the intent layer — who it's for, what they should feel, what it refuses, what done means. Definition of done: a check you can run; here, a script that prints pass or fail. Sign-up wall: asking for an account or an email before letting someone in.",
