      "beat_id": "B02",
      "act": "THE THREE FILES",
      "lane": "SHELL",
      "narration_text": "Three files, written by me, before the second run. CLAUDE.md: one file, no frameworks, no external requests, and run check.py before you say done. DESIGN.md: every aesthetic decision named — one typeface, black on off-white, one accent, no exclamation marks, no emoji, never the word welcome; and what silence means: no tagline, no FAQ. PROJECT.md: the five questions only I can answer. Who is this for. What should they feel. What does this refuse. What is done. What's out of scope. Nineteen lines. The design session, made durable.",
      "estimated_duration_s": 31.2,
      "voice": "am_onyx",
      "engine": "kokoro",
      "voice_kokoro": "am_onyx",
